# Host node_modules must never enter the context: the frontend stage runs its own
# `npm ci`, and copying the host's (darwin) tree over it would clobber the Linux
# install with platform-specific binaries.
**/node_modules
frontend/test-results
*.pdf
*.png
# but the PWA app icons are real source assets the SPA build needs
!frontend/public/*.png
